<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovakia Q2 GDP rises 6.9 pct y/y (+7.1 pct Q2/95).</title>
<headline>Slovakia Q2 GDP rises 6.9 pct y/y (+7.1 pct Q2/95).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak second quarter gross domestic product (GDP), in real terms, rose 6.9 percent year-on-year, compared with growth of 7.1 percent in the second quarter of 1995, the Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK REAL GDP    Q2 '96   Q1 '96   H1 996  FY '95   Q2 '95</p>
<p>  pct chg yr/yr	+6.9     +7.3     +7.1    +7.4     +7.1</p>
<p>Note. All figures are subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
